      "post": {
        "operationId": "createToken",
        "summary": "Make an access token",
        "description": "Makes an access token for a principal. The answer holds the token itself, and no other call ever shows it again; the server keeps only a hash of its secret. The token expires, in 90 days unless a lifetime of 1 hour to 365 days is asked, and carries the roles asked or all of the owner's. The Idempotency-Key is needed; the key of this call cannot be used again, because the answer holds a secret that is shown once. For administrators only.",
